WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:01.834 line:0%
-I want to thank my guests,

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:04.003 line:0%
Hilary, Larry, and Josh Meyers;

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.105 line:0%
and Frank Carter
and the 8G Band.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:07.741
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]
I want to thank all of you

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.308
for being with us
on this special night.

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:12.078
Everyone at home who took time
to be with us.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.546
I want to thank our crew

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.315
for working so hard
all year long

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:18.117
and our writing staff
for working so hard.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.552
I want to thank my wife

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:21.253
for getting
Thanksgiving dinner ready.

00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:24.190
Also, the video with the kids,
my wife wrangled that.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.558
That was not easy to do.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.493
I know it looked good,
but she did a lot of wrangling,

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:28.761
getting them
into those costumes,

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.195
so, I want to thank her
for that as well.

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:32.631
And I want to thank her
incredible family, my in-laws --

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:34.834
my sister-in-law,
my brother-in-law --

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.402
everyone who's getting dinner
ready for us.

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:37.904
And we really do appreciate it.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:39.372
Stay safe.
Get vaccinated.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.040
Get boosted.
We love you, everybody.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.775
[ Cheering and applause ]

